{
  "name": "agent402-client",
  "version": "0.10.1",
  "description": "Agent402 buyer SDK, the buy side of Agentic Finance: resolve a task to one of 500+ ready tools, call it with payment handled and verify its signed receipt - free via proof-of-work, or over x402 or MPP (a stock mppx fetch works) with a wallet you keep. Caching, idempotent retries (Idempotency-Key), non-custodial, zero dependencies.",
